Filhall guitar chords with strumming pattern sung by B Praak starring Akshay Kumar.

Strumming Pattern: D UUD UUD

[G#] [Gm] [Cm]X4

Ho kuchh [G#]aisa kar ka [Gm]mal,        Ke tera [Cm]ho jaoon
Ho kuchh [G#]aisa kar kamal,        Ke tera [Cm]ho jaoon

Main kisi [G#]aur ka hoon fil [Gm]hall,        Main kisi [Cm]aur ka hoon filhall
Ke tera [G#]ho jaoon [Gm]oon,        Main kisi [Cm]aur ka hoon filhall
Ke tera ho jaoon

Ae [G#]gall te galat [Gm]ae,        Jo vi [Cm]kar reha Jaani
Par [G#]ae vi dekh [Gm]tere bin,        Kinj [Cm]mar reha Jaani

Ho mar [G#]jaan'ge le sambhal,        Ho mar [Cm]jaan'ge le sambhal
Ke tera [G#]ho jaoon [Gm]oon,        Main kisi [Cm]aur ka hu filhall
Ke tera ho jaoon

[G#] [Gm] [Cm] X4

Mainu pa [G#]ta ke duniya [Gm]nu,        Eh [Cm]gawaara nai ho sakda
Par [G#]jhooth kehnde ne [Gm]saare,        Ke pyaar [Cm]dobara nai ho sakda
Par [G#]jhooth kende ne [Gm]saare,        Ke pyaar [Cm]dobara nai ho sakda

Tu mainu [G#]puch na koyi sa [Gm]wal,        Chal [Cm]door kitte mere naal
Ke tera ho jaoon [Gm]oon

Main kisi [G#]aur ka hoon fil [Gm]hall,        Ke tera [Cm]ho jaoon
Main kisi [G#]aur ka hoon fil [Gm]hall,        Ke tera [Cm]ho jaoon
O kisi [G#]aur ka hoon fil [Gm]hall,        Ke tera [Cm]ho jaoon

Hunn [G#]rona main, pachh [Gm]tauna main,        Ke [Cm]chann ni hoya chakor da
Hunn [G#]tu vi ae kise [Gm]hor di,        Main [Cm]vi aan kise hor da

Hunn [G#]rona main, pachh [Gm]tauna main,        Ke [Am]chann ni hoya chakor da
Hunn [G#]tu vi ae kise [Gm]hor di,        Main [Cm]vi aan kise hor da

Mera [G#]dil karda ae sa [Gm]wal,        Teri moha [Cm]bbat da ki hall
Ke tera [G#]ho jaoon [Gm]oon,        Main Kisi [Cm]aur ka hoon
Main Kisi Aur Ka Hoon filhall

